  "strings": [
    "Faramir fights valiantly against the forces of Mordor.\u0000",
    "But his warriors cannot all stand before the relentless tide.\u0000",
    "Many share a grim fate, and few survive the onrushing horror.\u0000",
    "Sauron's massive armies continue their great assault against us all.\u0000",
    "The remaining defenders of the West are the enemy's final barrier.\u0000",
    "For they wish to slay all who remain within Middle-earth.\u0000",
    "The enemy is as countless as the leaves of the forest...\u0000",
    "and hope seems lost.\u0000",
    "For the Dark Lord cares not how many shall fall.\u0000"
  ]
